<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Prabhjot Sir!</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif;
  background: #071525;
  color: #fff;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

#intro {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top, #234c69, transparent 60%),
    linear-gradient(145deg, #071525, #102c42);
}

.planet {
  font-size: 70px;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
  animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

h1 {
  font-size: clamp(34px, 8vw, 60px);
  color: #f7cf79;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.subtitle {
  color: #d8e4ed;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  max-width: 500px;
}

button {
  margin-top: 32px;
  border: 1px solid #f7cf79;
  border-radius: 40px;
  padding: 15px 27px;
  background: #f7cf79;
  color: #102238;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
  transform: scale(1.05);
  background: #ffe7ad;
}

#surprise {
  display: none;
  padding: 35px 20px 60px;
  text-align: center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #183a53, transparent 65%),
    #071525;
}

.section {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto 28px;
  padding: 28px 24px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(247,207,121,0.35);
  border-radius: 22px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.045);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
}

.emoji {
  font-size: 38px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

h2 {
  color: #f7cf79;
  font-size: 27px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

p {
  color: #e0e9ef;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.gold {
  color: #f7cf79;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.travel {
  font-size: 36px;
  letter-spacing: 9px;
  margin: 18px 0;
}

.quote {
  font-style: italic;
  color: #f7cf79;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

footer {
  padding: 15px;
  color: #b8c8d6;
  font-size: 13px;
}

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-13px); }
}

.confetti {
  position: fixed;
  top: -20px;
  z-index: 10;
  pointer-events: none;
  animation: fall linear forwards;
}

@keyframes fall {
  to {
    transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(720deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

.hidden {
  display: none;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<section id="intro">
  <div class="planet">🌍 ✈️</div>
  <p class="subtitle">A little surprise for someone who's always balancing numbers...</p>
  <h1>Prabhjot Sir!</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">
    Some people balance books.<br>
    Some people explore the world.<br>
    And some manage to do both! 😉
  </p>
  <button onclick="openSurprise()">
    🎁 Open Your Birthday Surprise
  </button>
</section>

<main id="surprise">

  <div class="section">
    <div class="emoji">🎂 ✨ 🥂</div>
    <h1>Happy Birthday!</h1>
    <h2>Prabhjot Sir</h2>
    <p>
      Wishing you a wonderful birthday filled with happiness,
      laughter, good health and countless reasons to smile.
      May this new year of your life bring success in every
      direction and adventures beyond your imagination!
    </p>
    <div class="travel">🌍 🏔️ 🧭 ✈️</div>
    <p class="quote">
      "May your life be rich in experiences,
      your memories priceless, and your happiness beyond measure."
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="emoji">💼 📊 🧮</div>
    <h2>For the CA Who Knows His Numbers!</h2>
    <p>
      Sir, you can balance accounts, analyse figures and
      handle financial complexities...
      <br><br>
      But here's one calculation even a CA can't complete:
      <br>
      <span class="gold">
        Total Happiness + Unlimited Adventures
        − All Worries = Your Best Year Yet!
      </span>
      <br><br>
      And may your happiness always be in surplus,
      your worries written off, and your luck never
      require an audit! 😂
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="emoji">🧭 🌄 🛫</div>
    <h2>Keep Exploring, Sir!</h2>
    <p>
      Some people collect things. Some collect achievements.
      But the best explorers collect stories, experiences
      and memories from places they've never been before.
      <br><br>
      May your passport fill with stamps, your camera
      fill with beautiful moments, and your life keep
      surprising you with destinations worth discovering.
      <br><br>
      <span class="gold">
        More mountains. More sunsets. More road trips.
        More unforgettable stories!
      </span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="emoji">😎 ☕ 😂</div>
    <h2>A Little Something From Your Colleague</h2>
    <p>
      Sir, you've only recently joined our firm,
      but your experience, friendly nature and sense of humour
      already make working together more enjoyable.
      <br><br>
      It's great to sit alongside someone who brings
      professional experience to the table and a little
      fun to the workday as well.
      <br><br>
      Here's wishing you many more years of success,
      new experiences, great conversations and
      plenty of reasons to laugh!
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="emoji">🌟 🎁 🎉</div>
    <h2>Your Birthday Wish</h2>
    <p>
      May every new chapter bring you wisdom,
      every journey bring you wonder, and every day
      give you something worth remembering.
      <br><br>
      Keep inspiring people with your experience,
      keep spreading smiles with your humour,
      and never lose that explorer spirit!
      <br><br>
      <span class="gold">
        Happy Birthday once again, Prabhjot Sir! 🥳
      </span>
    </p>
    <p class="quote">
      "The best is yet to come. Your next great adventure awaits!"
    </p>
  </div>

  <footer>
    Made with respect, good wishes & a little birthday creativity ✨
  </footer>

</main>

<script>
function openSurprise() {
  document.getElementById("intro").classList.add("hidden");
  document.getElementById("surprise").style.display = "block";
  window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: "smooth" });
  celebrate();
}

function celebrate() {
  const symbols = ["✨", "🎉", "🎊", "⭐", "🎈"];

  for (let i = 0; i < 65; i++) {
    const piece = document.createElement("div");
    piece.className = "confetti";
    piece.textContent =
      symbols[Math.floor(Math.random() * symbols.length)];

    piece.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
    piece.style.animationDuration =
      (2.5 + Math.random() * 3) + "s";
    piece.style.fontSize =
      (12 + Math.random() * 18) + "px";

    document.body.appendChild(piece);

    piece.addEventListener("animationend", () => piece.remove());
  }
}
</script>

</body>
</html>